  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="680" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">A pronoun. Used in this manner: Peh went to the Homosaurus website. I watched pehs browse the Homosaurus. Peh uses the Homosaurus pehself.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="680" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
